  "details": "Tried to launch into my home world today with `--enable-debug-gui --enable-sdk-log-levels --enable-udon-debug-logging` in my launch options and got an instant crash with no crashlog or dump.\nTried to debug it with other worlds by passing a launch url to the end of the launch options which crashed only every other time with the debug options enabled.\nRemoving the debug options seem to fix the issue.\nI can see the vrchat crash dump window pop up for a second but then it instantly closes with no crash data created in the folder.\nWhen using the launch url in the options to launch into other worlds - the crash dump window doesnt even appear - the game insta-closes right after initializing the world.\nThe last thing i can see in the normal log is `[API] Requesting Get favorite/groups`\n\nWorld in question (2017 upload) https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_6063acf2-f1ee-4d3a-8fd1-f3485561efcf\n\nHavent changed it since Februrary.\nAt least one other player confirmed to be crashing in that world with options enabled as well with the same last entry in logs. I used this as a home ever since i pushed it, visited with other players before as well, both with debug options and without and it was never an issue before.",
